flowchart LR
    A[AI request or plan]
    B[Declared workflow and intent]
    C[Transition gate and policy]
    D[Declared read/write boundary]
    E[Mutation execution]
    F[Observed effect verification]
    G[Ledger and lineage append]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G
    C -->|reject or hold| X[Fail-closed denial]
    F -->|undeclared mutation or mismatch| X
